<title>USA: N. American Mortgage Aug applications fall.</title>
<headline>N. American Mortgage Aug applications fall.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA ROSA, Calif. 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>North American Mortgage Co said on Friday that its August 1996 loan applications were $1.22 billion, a one percent decrease from August 1995 applications of $1.23 billion.</p>
<p>The company said that August 1996 loan fundings were $738 million, an eight percent decrease from August 1995 fundings of $802 million.</p>
<p>Refinancings represented 25 percent of total fundings and 33 percent of total applications for August 1996.</p>
</text>
